# Borrower-level exports stay OUT of git.
#
# Files under data/ are loan-level pulls containing real loan IDs, amounts,
# credit scores, DPD history and geography. They are regenerated in one command
# by anyone with Snowflake access — see the query inventory in README.md, e.g.
#
#   python3 tools/run_query.py \
#       queries/Q6_overrule_bucket_b_loan_level.sql \
#       --csv data/renewal_overrule_bucket_b_500_loans.csv
#
# Do not commit them, and never commit credentials or the Snowflake RSA key
# (~/.snowflake/rsa_key_sf_ds.p8).
data/
*.csv
!xgb_feature_list_combined_features_v5.0.0.csv

.env
*.p8
*.pem

.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
